abstract: >
  This artifact defines the Validation-Space-Time (vST) framework for Scientific Simulators.
  It includes substrate definitions, regime structures, scaling behavior,
  projection and alignment methods, validation layers, drift detection,
  examples, and appendices. It is part of the seven-artifact vST canon.
